{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024710/extras/BlackSubmarineDiscord-en.png?t=1740750086\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by a Brazilian translated with love to English!\u00a0\ud83d\udc99\u2764\ufe0f #indieDev</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Black Submarine</strong> is a thrilling underwater adventure that puts you in control of a powerful, ultra-technological submarine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024710/extras/BSds01.gif?t=1740750086\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 2086, the Pacific Ocean harbors profound secrets and unimaginable dangers. Navigate treacherous waters, face deadly enemies, and discover deep secrets beneath the sea. This game combines intense action, exploration, and strategy, offering a unique and immersive experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to plunge into this submerged journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024710/extras/4chapters.png?t=1740750086\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-Player Campaign:</strong> Embark on a journey that explores stories inspired by the folklore of the underwater world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024710/extras/BSds02v2.gif?t=1740750086\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Combat:</strong> Use laser weapons and equipment to overcome waves of dangerous sea creatures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024710/extras/BSds03.gif?t=1740750086\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Underwater Exploration:</strong> Dive into underwater caves and a sunken pirate ship in search of treasure and valuable resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024710/extras/BSds04.gif?t=1740750086\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Submarine Customization:</strong> Upgrade your submarine to prepare for future challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready to dive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0<strong>Black Submarine: deep seek</strong>, each dive is a unique adventure filled with dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to uncover the hidden secrets in the depths of the Pacific?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive in now and discover the mysteries that await!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"PIRATE SEREYA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024710/e55544d37831edb5a317ef4e8a3bda4dd0f54930.jpg"},{"name":"MERMAID NICOLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024710/6ad276777c37cce0861286a65c3dab0fc3d0f6cd.jpg"},{"name":"MARIANA TRENCH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024710/2179b7092e5f270e02be0a8eb9ff250db00b5272.jpg"},{"name":"POSEIDON LUKE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024710/2d5e2e94c1a28dac5c2f7b931fb675addc5d0417.jpg"},{"name":"BLACK SUBMARINE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3024710/b46c3f727e9ac1abb200b695d28709d863287f73.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3024710?t=1740750086","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_